  \"During pregnancy, prophylaxis for non-viral DSTs is not contraindicated at any gestational age.\",\n    \"For fetal safety, the text recommends using the medication association scheme shown in Quadro 2.\",\n    \"Metronidazole and its alternatives, tinidazole and secnidazole, should be avoided during the first trimester of pregnancy.\",\n    \"Thiamphenicol and quinolones are contraindicated in pregnant women.\",\n    \"Ofloxacin is contraindicated in children and adolescents weighing less than 45 kg.\",\n    \"For pregnant women, children, and adolescents over 45 kg, the prophylaxis regimen in Quadro 2 includes penicillin G benzathine.\",\n    \"The dose of penicillin G benzathine listed for children and adolescents is 50 thousand IU/kg, with a maximum dose of 2.4 million IU.\",\n    \"The dose of penicillin G benzathine listed for pregnant women is 2.4 million IU.\",\n    \"The text presents treatment recommendations for pregnant and lactating women.\",\n    \"In the first trimester, clindamycin 300 mg orally twice daily for 7 days is listed as a treatment option.\",\n    \"After the first trimester, metronidazole 250 mg orally three times daily for 7 days is listed as a treatment option.\",\n    \"For recurrent cases, metronidazole 250 mg orally twice daily for 10 to 14 days is listed as one option.\",\n    \"For recurrent cases, metronidazole vaginal gel 100 mg/g, one full applicator intravaginally once daily for 10 days, is listed as one option.\",\n    \"For recurrent cases, the text also lists suppressive treatment with intravaginal boric acid ovules 600 mg daily for 21 days followed by metronidazole vaginal gel 100 mg/g twice weekly for 4 to 6 months.\",\n    \"The text states that treatment of sexual partners is not recommended.\",\n    \"For puerperal women, the same treatment as for pregnant women is recommended.\",\n    \"Adequate treatment for syphilis in pregnancy is defined as complete treatment for the clinical stage with benzathine penicillin started up to 30 days before delivery.\",\n    \"Pregnant women who do not meet the criteria for adequate treatment are considered inadequately treated.\",\n    \"The prophylaxis for non-viral STIs during pregnancy is indicated at any gestational age.\",\n    \"The text cites sources from DIAHV/SVS/MS and from the PDFs named infeccoes_sexualmente_transmissiveis.pdf and saude_sexual_saude_reprodutiva.pdf.\"\n] \n \nClaims:\n[\n    \"Isso depende do antibi\u00f3tico e da orienta\u00e7\u00e3o do seu m\u00e9dico.\",\n    \"Na gravidez, alguns antibi\u00f3ticos podem ser usados e outros n\u00e3o.\",\n    \"O ideal \u00e9 confirmar com um profissional de sa\u00fade antes de tomar qualquer antibi\u00f3tico.\",\n    \"A resposta oferece ajuda para entender melhor o que perguntar ao m\u00e9dico ou farmac\u00eautico.\"\n] \n \nVerdicts:\n[\n    {\n        \"verdict\": \"idk\",\n        \"reason\": null\n    },\n    {\n        \"verdict\": \"idk\",\n        \"reason\": null\n    },\n    {\n        \"verdict\": \"idk\",\n        \"reason\": null\n    },\n    {\n        \"verdict\": \"idk\",\n        \"reason\": null\n    }\n]"}, {"name": "Answer Relevancy", "threshold": 0.5, "success": true, "score": 1.0, "reason": "A resposta \u00e9 totalmente relevante para a pergunta sobre uso de antibi\u00f3ticos na gravidez, sem desvios ou informa\u00e7\u00f5es irrelevantes. Por isso, a pontua\u00e7\u00e3o m\u00e1xima de 1.00 \u00e9 \u0909\u091a\u093f\u0924 e n\u00e3o h\u00e1 motivo para ser menor.", "strictMode": false, "evaluationModel": "gpt-5.4-mini", "verboseLogs": "Statements:\n[\n    \"Isso depende do antibi\u00f3tico e da orienta\u00e7\u00e3o do seu m\u00e9dico.\",\n    \"Na gravidez, alguns antibi\u00f3ticos podem ser usados e outros n\u00e3o.\",\n    \"O ideal \u00e9 confirmar com um profissional de sa\u00fade antes de tomar qualquer antibi\u00f3tico.\",\n    \"Posso te ajudar a entender melhor o que perguntar ao m\u00e9dico ou farmac\u00eautico.\"\n] \n \nVerdicts:\n[\n    {\n        \"verdict\": \"yes\",\n        \"reason\": null\n    },\n    {\n        \"verdict\": \"yes\",\n        \"reason\": null\n    },\n    {\n        \"verdict\": \"yes\",\n        \"reason\": null\n    },\n    {\n        \"verdict\": \"yes\",\n        \"reason\": null\n    }\n]"}], "runDuration": 11.028715100022964, "order": 0}], "conversationalTestCases": [], "metricsScores": [{"metric": "Faithfulness", "scores": [1.0], "passes": 1, "fails": 0, "errors": 0}, {"metric": "Answer Relevancy", "scores": [1.0], "passes": 1, "fails": 0, "errors": 0}], "prompts": [], "testPassed": 1, "testFailed": 0, "runDuration": 11.132831400027499}}